Package: bs0405.vieweR
Title: Interactive BS0405 Overflow Event Explorer
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Zac",
      family = "Driscoll",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "your@email.com"
    )
Description:
    An interactive Shiny application for exploring historical BS0405 overflow
    events. The application provides event-level visualizations of overflow
    pump operation, system levels, and gate positions alongside historical
    summaries of overflow volume, duration, and event frequency. Data are
    retrieved from MMSD historian and overflow databases and presented through
    an interactive dashboard intended to support operational review,
    investigation, and trend analysis.
